OL,3,GNEWSAFirefighters tackle blaze at
OL,4,Aformer library
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirefighters tackled a blaze at a
OL,7,Fformer library as police urged
OL,8,Fresidents to keep away from the area.
OL,10,FCleveland Police said it was called to
OL,11,Fassist the fire service at Billingham's
OL,12,Fformer library, at the back of
OL,13,FBillingham Health Centre, in Queensway,
OL,14,Fon Tuesday evening.
OL,16,FPhotographs of the scene showed a
OL,17,Fbuilding well alight as fire crews
OL,18,Fworked to keep it under control. No
OL,19,Ffurther details were released.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
