OL,3,GNEWSAFirefighters tackle blaze at
OL,4,Aformer library
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe force advised residents living
OL,7,Fnearby to keep doors and windows
OL,8,Fclosed. Road closures at Causeway and
OL,9,FKingsway were partially lifted in the
OL,10,Fearly hours of the morning, with
OL,11,FCauseway remaining closed between
OL,12,FFinchale Avenue and Kingsway
OL,13,FRoundabout.
